  "description": "Add variety to your everyday life – your Backroad AL EQ is ready for it. Whether new routes to daily destinations or into nature with no set path: With well thought-out equipment, space for luggage, comfortable geometry and a sturdy aluminium frame, you can do everything from commuting to bikepacking. You decide where to go. Highlights: • Integrated frame compartment – with tool bag for your tools • USB-C port – power directly on the handlebar (power bank required) • 18 attachment points – plenty of space for bottles, bags and cages • Custom-fit frame bags – available as accessories • Dynamo-powered lighting system – with up to 100 lux lighting power • Integrated mudguards – with luggage rails for panniers The Backroad AL EQ comes with a high-quality component mix from the Shimano GRX RX820 and RX610 series, doublespeed shifting with 2x12 gears, fast 35 mm Grand Prix Urban tyres from Continental and sturdy DT Swiss G1800 wheels. With mudguards, lights and a versatile gravel handlebar, the urban gravel bike accompanies you everywhere. Weight: approx. 11.8 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, reference frame colour dune, size M, without pedals and tool bag",
